			}
		}
	],

	"notes": [
		"All 11 rules ship DISABLED. Review them in the rule list and enable individually or via 'Enable all just-imported'.",
		"Folder templates use the trailing-glob relaxation — '0 - Tasks, Planning/{deeper...}' matches the bare '0 - Tasks, Planning' folder AND any descendant.",
		"Detection requires 4+ of the 11 numbered/framework roots to surface this pack."
	]
}
